# metals.inp -- set trace-metal abundances at runtime (no recompile).
# Copy to ./metals.inp (next to input.inp) to activate metals.
# One ion per line: <ION> <abundance n_X/n_H by number>.
# '#' starts a comment. Recognized: C/N/O/Mg/Si/Ca/Na/K/S/Fe
# (neutral-ion labels like CI also accepted). A missing metals.inp
# leaves metals off.
#
# Optional keys:
#   pp_metals <0|1|2>  metal treatment in the advection post-process
#                      (0 metal-free, 1 frozen eq metals, 2 re-solve)
#   cx_full   <0|1>    full Huang Table 4 charge exchange (default 0)
#   cno_cool  <0|1>    C/N/O line-cooling source (default 1):
#                      1 = CHIANTI v11 closed-form fits (incl. N I/N II)
#                      0 = legacy AIOLOS fits (no N cooling)
#   eos_metals <0|1>   bulk-gas metal policy (default 1):
#                      1 = metals contribute their mass (rho_bc, calc_rho),
#                          electrons (calc_ne, dp_bc) and nuclei (calc_ntot,
#                          base pressure) to the gas budget (~1% in mass
#                          at solar abundances)
#                      0 = legacy trace approximation (H/He-only budget)
#
# Solar abundances (Asplund+2009):
C     2.69e-4
N     6.76e-5
O     4.90e-4
